u</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Solberg</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Wamai</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Bikaako-Kajura</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Changes in sexual behavior and risk of HIV transmission after antiretroviral therapy and prevention interventions in rural Uganda.</article-title><source>AIDS</source><volume>20</volume><fpage>85</fpage><lpage>92</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16327323</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002077-Eisele1"><label>41</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Eisele</surname><given-names>TP</given-names></name><name><surname>Mathews</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Chopra</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Silvestre</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>High Levels of Risk Behavior Among People Living with HIV Initiating and Waiting to Start Antiretroviral Therapy in Cape Town South Africa.</article-title><source>AIDS Behav</source></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests: </bold>The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>The authors have no support or funding to report.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>